The sprint board is built in plain TypeScript and DOM under `src/`: `main.ts` (tabs and mount), `board.ts`, `archive.ts` and a small `dom.ts` helper. `./check` passes and all 26 visible tests pass in `./test` (2 of 15 runs used). I was unsure about one console 404 that appears during the first test; I believe it is a favicon request, not the app, and the hidden tests may cover edge cases the visible ones do not.